# OmniGrid planning index

Navigation only. This file is not an architecture or status authority.

## Normal milestone read order

1. `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` - complete, always.
2. `docs/ROADMAP.md` - complete when selecting/planning a milestone.
3. selected `docs/milestones/Mxx.md` - complete.
4. `docs/ACTIVE_FINDINGS.md` - only when it targets the selected milestone.
5. domain docs listed by that milestone - complete.
6. current source/tests/CMake, `git status` and relevant diff.
7. old ADR/report/generated output only when a concrete current question makes
   that exact material relevant.

Do NOT enumerate/read every Markdown file. Do NOT bulk-read old reports,
session notes, generated Graphify reports or historical status prose simply
because they exist.

## Current main spine

M01 -> M02 -> M03 -> M04 -> M05 -> M06 -> M07 -> M08 -> M10.

Current state is read only from `docs/ROADMAP.md`; this navigation file never
duplicates milestone status.

One `/loop` handles one milestone candidate. Internal implementation steps are
not separate public review rounds.
